---------------------------

Identity theft occurs when someone steals your personal information, such as your name, social security number, credit card information, or other sensitive data, and uses it without your permission to commit fraud or other crimes. This can happen in a variety of ways, such as:

* Stealing your mail or trash to get access to your bills or credit card statements
